OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD hails big
OL,4,Avictory in east, but falls short of
OL,5,Amajority
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfD's charismatic leader in the state,
OL,8,FUlrich Siegmund, said it was
OL,9,F"sensational" and the party had won a
OL,10,Fmandate to govern.
OL,12,FNo far-right party has controlled a
OL,13,FGerman state since World War Two, and
OL,14,Fgoverning at state level would mean
OL,15,Fpowers over policing, local education
OL,16,Fand culture.
